{"logId": "80e42a76-094d-42e1-a3c6-a812322c7d10", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [839, 134, 1083, 253], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[839.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [839.0, 253.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "爱在胖东来", "block_bbox": [239, 228, 506, 283], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 228.0], [506.0, 228.0], [506.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：新乡百货/李梦姣", "block_bbox": [331, 292, 506, 314], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[331.0, 292.0], [505.0, 292.0], [505.0, 313.0], [331.0, 313.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我是胖东来的一名促销员，在这里上班的半年时间里，不断地感受到来自这个大家庭的温暖，店里的员工对待顾客更是无微不至，我也经常看到周围发生的那些感人的事，虽然不是什么惊天动地的大事，但正是这些小事，体现了胖东来人的热情、真诚。", "block_bbox": [198, 372, 976, 469], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 372.0], [976.0, 372.0], [976.0, 469.0], [198.0, 469.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "有一次去厕所，刚推开门，就看到乱哄哄的好多人挤了一大群，还听到有人说：“肯定捡不出来了。”立刻有人附和道：“是啊，这怎么带啊。”听到她们讨论我才知道，原来有位顾客不小心把手机掉进便池里了，负责打扫厕所卫生的保洁员阿姨正在帮她捞手机。保洁姨手里拿着一个铁丝弯成的小钩慢慢地探试，只听到金属碰撞发出的声音，似乎是手机链在响，可就是不见手机被钩上来。手机的主人在旁边很着急，保洁姨突然做了一件大家都没想到的事，她丢掉手中的铁钩，蹲下身子用手捞！或许是她的动作惊呆了所有人，大家都停止了议论看着她，我们都看到了保洁姨额头上滴下的汗水……过了两三分钟，突然看到保洁姨脸上露出了一点笑脸，“可能捞到了吧。”人群中有人说。果然，保洁姨伸出手直起身子，手里握着一部手机，那部手机已经有点旧了，可对他的主要来说，它很重要。手机的主人千恩万谢，说了好多话，可那位保洁姨一副平静的样子，静静地", "block_bbox": [197, 477, 977, 818], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 477.0], [977.0, 477.0], [977.0, 818.0], [197.0, 818.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [201, 829, 503, 1268], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 829.0], [503.0, 829.0], [503.0, 1268.0], [201.0, 1268.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "说：“快看看坏了没，还能不能用了，下次注意一点。”\n话虽不多，但字字朴实，没有一点点张扬或得意。", "block_bbox": [482, 825, 964, 886], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[482.0, 825.0], [964.0, 825.0], [964.0, 886.0], [482.0, 886.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "旁边围观的人又开始讨论了，有人夸赞，也有人鄙夷，说那么脏竟然用手捞，但立刻招来了所有人的谴责，等她们议论完，回过身，那位保洁姨已经离开去清理别处了。我顿时对这位保洁姨心生敬佩，不怕脏，不怕累，一心只为方便顾客，这不正是胖东来人的风格么？", "block_bbox": [520, 895, 977, 1096], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[520.0, 895.0], [977.0, 895.0], [977.0, 1096.0], [520.0, 1096.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "这样的事在胖东来时刻都在上演，也正是这样一件件小事，体现出了胖东来人的乐于奉献精神，又因为胖东来有一群这样乐于奉献的人，才使顾客朋友真正感受到“爱在胖东来！”", "block_bbox": [505, 1104, 977, 1236], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[505.0, 1104.0], [977.0, 1104.0], [977.0, 1236.0], [505.0, 1236.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "珍藏在我内心深处的感动", "block_bbox": [110, 1406, 506, 1449], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 1406.0], [506.0, 1406.0], [506.0, 1449.0], [110.0, 1449.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1001, 609, 1137, 725], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[1001.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1001.0, 725.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.6868026256561279, "coordinate": [839, 134, 1083, 253], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[839.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [839.0, 253.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.8799150586128235, "coordinate": [239, 228, 506, 283], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 228.0], [506.0, 228.0], [506.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7756443023681641, "coordinate": [331, 292, 506, 314], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[331.0, 292.0], [505.0, 292.0], [505.0, 313.0], [331.0, 313.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9320390820503235, "coordinate": [198, 372, 976, 469], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 372.0], [976.0, 372.0], [976.0, 469.0], [198.0, 469.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9589699506759644, "coordinate": [197, 477, 977, 818], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 477.0], [977.0, 477.0], [977.0, 818.0], [197.0, 818.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.44208458065986633, "coordinate": [204, 829, 503, 1083], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[204.0, 829.0], [503.0, 829.0], [503.0, 1083.0], [204.0, 1083.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6570320725440979, "coordinate": [201, 829, 503, 1268], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[201.0, 829.0], [503.0, 829.0], [503.0, 1268.0], [201.0, 1268.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.38428330421447754, "coordinate": [212, 1086, 489, 1265], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[212.0, 1086.0], [489.0, 1086.0], [489.0, 1265.0], [212.0, 1265.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8369684219360352, "coordinate": [482, 825, 964, 886], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[482.0, 825.0], [964.0, 825.0], [964.0, 886.0], [482.0, 886.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9317929744720459, "coordinate": [520, 895, 977, 1096], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[520.0, 895.0], [977.0, 895.0], [977.0, 1096.0], [520.0, 1096.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9289340376853943, "coordinate": [505, 1104, 977, 1236], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[505.0, 1104.0], [977.0, 1104.0], [977.0, 1236.0], [505.0, 1236.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4247967004776001, "coordinate": [110, 1406, 506, 1449], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[110.0, 1406.0], [506.0, 1406.0], [506.0, 1449.0], [110.0, 1449.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6001348495483398, "coordinate": [1001, 609, 1137, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1001.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1001.0, 725.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 爱在胖东来\n\n作者：新乡百货/李梦姣\n\n我是胖东来的一名促销员，在这里上班的半年时间里，不断地感受到来自这个大家庭的温暖，店里的员工对待顾客更是无微不至，我也经常看到周围发生的那些感人的事，虽然不是什么惊天动地的大事，但正是这些小事，体现了胖东来人的热情、真诚。\n\n有一次去厕所，刚推开门，就看到乱哄哄的好多人挤了一大群，还听到有人说：“肯定捡不出来了。”立刻有人附和道：“是啊，这怎么带啊。”听到她们讨论我才知道，原来有位顾客不小心把手机掉进便池里了，负责打扫厕所卫生的保洁员阿姨正在帮她捞手机。保洁姨手里拿着一个铁丝弯成的小钩慢慢地探试，只听到金属碰撞发出的声音，似乎是手机链在响，可就是不见手机被钩上来。手机的主人在旁边很着急，保洁姨突然做了一件大家都没想到的事，她丢掉手中的铁钩，蹲下身子用手捞！或许是她的动作惊呆了所有人，大家都停止了议论看着她，我们都看到了保洁姨额头上滴下的汗水……过了两三分钟，突然看到保洁姨脸上露出了一点笑脸，“可能捞到了吧。”人群中有人说。果然，保洁姨伸出手直起身子，手里握着一部手机，那部手机已经有点旧了，可对他的主要来说，它很重要。手机的主人千恩万谢，说了好多话，可那位保洁姨一副平静的样子，静静地\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_201_829_503_1268.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"25%\" /></div>\n\n\n说：“快看看坏了没，还能不能用了，下次注意一点。”\n\n话虽不多，但字字朴实，没有一点点张扬或得意。\n\n旁边围观的人又开始讨论了，有人夸赞，也有人鄙夷，说那么脏竟然用手捞，但立刻招来了所有人的谴责，等她们议论完，回过身，那位保洁姨已经离开去清理别处了。我顿时对这位保洁姨心生敬佩，不怕脏，不怕累，一心只为方便顾客，这不正是胖东来人的风格么？\n\n这样的事在胖东来时刻都在上演，也正是这样一件件小事，体现出了胖东来人的乐于奉献精神，又因为胖东来有一群这样乐于奉献的人，才使顾客朋友真正感受到“爱在胖东来！”\n\n珍藏在我内心深处的感动\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1137_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1083_253.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//80e42a76-094d-42e1-a3c6-a812322c7d10/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1083_253.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A07%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff4937420bfe69dd3e65496fd31b7cfdccd5377c8250e8cc213994eed306a2990", "imgs/img_in_image_box_201_829_503_1268.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//80e42a76-094d-42e1-a3c6-a812322c7d10/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_201_829_503_1268.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A07%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa8148a65085199e8afd2cca5f36c775ff5ee376802beb26eea8eae956ac46572", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1137_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//80e42a76-094d-42e1-a3c6-a812322c7d10/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1137_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A07%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe473f85b41db4a301a333a183f8d28a69351de951e7adbeff2bd016234314324", "imgs/img_in_image_box_204_829_503_1083.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//80e42a76-094d-42e1-a3c6-a812322c7d10/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_204_829_503_1083.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A07%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2F5b903c5727c57594a1f9057904bf6a3c62584eed3c81706445c3d42eb1d8731d", "imgs/img_in_image_box_212_1086_489_1265.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//80e42a76-094d-42e1-a3c6-a812322c7d10/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_212_1086_489_1265.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A07%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2F38af8902f72a95535463f71fbe5bd286d29f0e1cf99cb7005c9003f2d65c0992"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//80e42a76-094d-42e1-a3c6-a812322c7d10/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A07%3A21Z%2F-1%2F%2F471a73f1314aeae14b515099949079cb553a6e425f2ec2d55b0a0834061d5d1b"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//80e42a76-094d-42e1-a3c6-a812322c7d10/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaR